      "narration": "每个三角形都有三个角，我们叫它们角1、角2、角3。这三个角的度数加起来就是三角形的内角和。那么内角和到底是多少度呢？我们来做一个小实验！",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "main-triangle",
            "type": "triangle",
            "points": [{"x": 200, "y": 70}, {"x": 110, "y": 200}, {"x": 290, "y": 200}],
            "fill": "#eef2ff",
            "stroke": "#6366f1",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "angle1-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 140,
            "y": 185,
            "text": "角1",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "textFill": "#10b981"
          },
          {
            "id": "angle2-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 260,
            "y": 185,
            "text": "角2",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "textFill": "#3b82f6"
          },
          {
            "id": "angle3-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 200,
            "y": 95,
